stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Draft
  Draft --> Open: person starts concern
  Open --> AwaitingInformation: accepted request
  AwaitingInformation --> Open: result or unavailable
  Open --> AwaitingReview: review needed
  AwaitingReview --> Followup: attributed review
  Followup --> Open: new concern or evidence
  Open --> Resolved: authorized reason recorded
  Followup --> Resolved: authorized reason recorded
  Resolved --> Open: recurrence
  note right of Open: Acknowledged is an event, not resolution
